node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
# Incremental build state must never enter the build context. With it present,
# `tsc -b` inside the image reads it, concludes everything is already compiled
# and emits nothing — while dist itself is excluded, leaving an image with no
# compiled output. It only breaks when building from an already-built tree, so
# a clean clone would hide it.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
data
.venv-inference
infra/bundle/out
.git
tests/fixtures/tmp
*.log
# The inference image fetches and verifies its own weights during the build,
# so there is no reason to ship 180MB of them into the build context.
assets/vendor/models

# Generated during the image build. Copying the local copies in would bake
# whatever happened to be on the build machine into the image instead.
apps/api/public/brand
apps/api/public/vendor
